{"schema_version": "1.0", "run_id": "day26-v8-f-dev-s100", "run_spec_sha256": "54741df3695c8539f73660229c75e651985b2e36e7dd1ec62d81f4c57106ce15", "split": "dev", "execution_index": 7, "case_id": "formula-v8-dev-03--direct", "model": "lora", "lora_scale": 1.0, "completed_at": "2026-08-24T03:49:43.569290+00:00", "response": "好的，以下是转写的 LaTeX 代码：\n\n```latex\n\\documentclass{article}\n\\usepackage{amsmath}\n\n\\begin{document}\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{c}\nx \\\\\nx^2 \\\\\n\\frac{b}{2a}x \\\\\n\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2\n\\end{array}\n=\n\\begin{array}{c}\n\\textcolor{red}{-\\frac{c}{a}} \\\\\n\\textcolor{red}{+\\left(\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2}\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n\\end{document}\n```\n\n这段代码生成了与图片中相同的数学表达式。", "input_tokens": 366, "output_tokens": 144, "generation_seconds": 8.034, "latency_seconds": 8.092, "peak_gpu_memory_mib": 16351.193}
